WEBVTT

00:04.790 --> 00:05.790
<b>Hestia.</b>

00:07.540 --> 00:08.790
<b>I declare a War Game.</b>

00:10.250 --> 00:12.130
<b>If I win, Bell is mine.</b>

00:12.830 --> 00:16.250
<b>And if I lose, I'll go back to Heaven
or whatever else you want.</b>

00:17.130 --> 00:18.210
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

00:18.630 --> 00:20.750
<b>After what you did to everyone in Orario,
you have no right to-</b>

00:20.750 --> 00:22.540
<b>No matter what penalty I face from the Guild,</b>

00:23.460 --> 00:25.830
<b>as long as the Three Great Quests remain incomplete,</b>

00:26.580 --> 00:29.130
<b>they would never dare to dissolve us.</b>

00:30.790 --> 00:33.040
<b>That's how strong my Familia is.</b>

00:33.580 --> 00:35.630
<b>And how influential my social status is.</b>

00:36.790 --> 00:39.130
<b>But I'm willing to wager all of that.</b>

00:40.380 --> 00:43.460
<b>You're more than welcome to form
a faction with other Familias.</b>

00:43.960 --> 00:46.920
<b>I'll fight back with nothing but my own Familia.</b>

00:47.880 --> 00:48.960
<b>So come at me.</b>

00:49.670 --> 00:52.170
<b>Well, Bell, what do you think?</b>

00:56.080 --> 00:59.750
<b>If I win, will you also agree to do something for me?</b>

01:00.210 --> 01:01.080
<b>Fine.</b>

01:01.380 --> 01:03.080
<b>What exactly do you want?</b>

01:03.420 --> 01:06.380
<b>I want one more chance to meet with Ms. Syr.</b>

01:07.880 --> 01:08.580
<b>No.</b>

01:09.420 --> 01:11.750
<b>I want to meet with the real you.</b>

01:17.250 --> 01:18.670
<b>Whatever makes you happy.</b>

01:20.710 --> 01:21.630
<b>All right.</b>

01:22.420 --> 01:23.790
<b>You're on, Freya.</b>

01:24.540 --> 01:25.630
<b>It's a War Game!</b>

01:29.500 --> 01:32.670
<b>You are such a stupid woman.</b>

01:36.380 --> 01:37.630
<b>Just you wait, Syr.</b>

01:39.080 --> 01:42.080
<b>I won't rest until I've slapped you into tomorrow.</b>

01:45.250 --> 01:50.290
<b>Kyou no story toki ni yo wa irony</b>

01:50.540 --> 01:54.420
<b>"Soredemo..." tte kokoro ni</b>

01:54.420 --> 02:00.000
<b>Mitsuke dashita bokura no sekai</b>

02:09.420 --> 02:14.880
<b>Ano hi kara koko ni iru motome tsuzuke sagashiteru</b>

02:15.130 --> 02:21.670
<b>Yowasa ni deau tabi ikutsumo ikutsumo koenakucha</b>

02:21.670 --> 02:25.710
<b>Sono tabi ni namida o koraete wa</b>

02:25.960 --> 02:30.750
<b>Tachiagatte asu asatte sou yattekita no sa</b>

02:30.920 --> 02:36.040
<b>Kore made o shinjite susunda sono saki de</b>

02:36.210 --> 02:41.000
<b>Kakegaenonai mono bokura o matsu</b>

02:41.210 --> 02:45.670
<b>Bouken no story hajimari wa kyou de ii</b>

02:45.960 --> 02:51.750
<b>Itamashii elegy dare mo utawanuyou ni</b>

02:52.130 --> 02:56.630
<b>Aa tsuyoku naritai hangeki no hajimari</b>

02:56.750 --> 03:00.170
<b>Kakkowarukute ii</b>

03:00.540 --> 03:06.250
<b>Aa deai ga ai soko ni itanda ne</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:18.750
<b>War Game</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:18.750
<b>The Great Faction Battle</b>

03:16.080 --> 03:18.880
<b>The Freya Familia declared a War Game?!</b>

03:18.880 --> 03:21.040
<b>Yeah, against some kind of allied army.</b>

03:21.170 --> 03:23.790
<b>It seems like everyone is really upset with them this time.</b>

03:24.130 --> 03:27.130
<b>Rumor has it a bunch of different Familia
are going to participate.</b>

03:24.130 --> 03:25.080
<b>One of these, please.</b>

03:26.880 --> 03:27.420
<b>Here.</b>

03:27.420 --> 03:28.210
<b>Thanks!</b>

03:28.420 --> 03:31.290
<b>Well, the Loki Familia has gotta be the first in line, right?</b>

03:31.290 --> 03:33.630
<b>It'll be a real nasty fight.</b>

03:34.170 --> 03:36.380
<b>This makes no sense!</b>

03:36.380 --> 03:39.630
<b>What do you mean you won't participate
in the War Game, Loki?!</b>

03:39.920 --> 03:45.330
<b>A bunch of other Familia that were raring to go have
chickened out ever since you said you wouldn't join us!</b>

03:46.000 --> 03:47.420
<b>I don't got a choice.</b>

03:47.420 --> 03:49.170
<b>The Guild put the kibosh on us.</b>

03:49.420 --> 03:52.210
<b>The Loki Familia is officially banned from participating.</b>

03:52.630 --> 03:55.880
<b>Even if we try to ignore it, then our side
insta-loses for breaking the rules!</b>

03:56.040 --> 03:57.540
<b>Grrrr...</b>

03:57.540 --> 04:01.790
<b>The bottom line is the Guild won't allow a war that
tips the scales of power in Orario too far to one side.</b>

04:02.040 --> 04:03.000
<b>Well, listen.</b>

04:03.210 --> 04:07.920
<b>All you have to do is lay out the rules of the showdown
so the allied army has a shot at winning.</b>

04:08.460 --> 04:10.790
<b>That's the whole reason this Denatus is being held.</b>

04:10.790 --> 04:13.750
<b>So do your best to argue
your way to a beneficial position.</b>

04:13.750 --> 04:15.080
<b>Grrrr...</b>

04:15.080 --> 04:16.540
<b>Take it easy, Hestia.</b>

04:16.880 --> 04:18.880
<b>You won't get them to repeal that decision.</b>

04:19.380 --> 04:21.790
<b>But it doesn't change our feelings on the matter.</b>

04:22.130 --> 04:23.880
<b>We still stand with you.</b>

04:25.290 --> 04:26.420
<b>All right.</b>

04:26.830 --> 04:32.080
<b>But can we at least borrow Wallenwhatsit
from you until the War Game starts?</b>

04:32.580 --> 04:33.330
<b>Nuh-uh.</b>

04:33.330 --> 04:34.080
<b>Wha?!</b>

04:35.750 --> 04:38.130
<b>Ais has already been put in a tight spot.</b>

04:45.210 --> 04:46.830
<b>How many times must I say it!</b>

04:47.000 --> 04:52.040
<b>We cannot afford to have the Loki Familia and
Freya Familia crushing each other in a War Game!</b>

04:52.380 --> 04:53.790
<b>It's like I keep telling you.</b>

04:54.040 --> 04:56.000
<b>Nobody from our Familia will be happy with that,</b>

04:56.000 --> 04:57.630
<b>and I'm not going to force it on them.</b>

04:58.170 --> 05:00.670
<b>That's how egregious the Freya Familia's actions are.</b>

05:03.080 --> 05:04.250
<b>Very well, then.</b>

05:06.710 --> 05:07.790
<b>What is that?</b>

05:08.130 --> 05:12.170
<b>We will provide information about the area down
on the 60th floor, the Thalia Glacier.</b>

05:12.710 --> 05:14.080
<b>But in exchange...</b>

05:14.080 --> 05:15.880
<b>you must pull out of the War Game!</b>

05:23.670 --> 05:27.040
<b>So, is this yet another part of Goddess Freya's scheme?</b>

05:27.540 --> 05:29.500
<b>Stop with the rude accusations.</b>

05:30.420 --> 05:35.380
<b>Lady Freya proposed this battle with the full intent
of defeating every Familia in Orario, including yours.</b>

05:37.130 --> 05:39.710
<b>Well, I'm siding with the Hestia Familia.</b>

05:40.420 --> 05:42.380
<b>We're not banned from providing assistance.</b>

05:43.420 --> 05:46.500
<b>In other words, you're going fill
that Prum's head with your tricks.</b>

05:47.290 --> 05:51.500
<b>I wonder if she'll be able to maintain her composure
without breaking down in tears.</b>

05:52.580 --> 05:54.500
<b>Master Bell!</b>

05:55.000 --> 05:56.710
<b>I'm so sorry!</b>

05:56.710 --> 05:58.130
<b>Forgive me!</b>

05:58.540 --> 06:00.670
<b>It feels like I stabbed you in the back.</b>

05:59.710 --> 06:01.080
<b>I said so many awful things to you.</b>

06:01.290 --> 06:02.920
<b>I failed to save you in a time of need.</b>

06:02.250 --> 06:05.170
<b>I don't know how I can ever make it up to you!</b>

06:02.880 --> 06:05.170
<b>I'm the worst Advisor ever!</b>

06:02.920 --> 06:04.670
<b>What kind of friend am I?!</b>

06:04.290 --> 06:05.920
<b>My bad, Bell! I'm sorry!</b>

06:04.670 --> 06:05.920
<b>No amount of apology can make up for it!</b>

06:06.880 --> 06:07.750
<b>Um...</b>

06:09.460 --> 06:10.830
<b>Listen, guys.</b>

06:12.630 --> 06:15.580
<b>This next fight is too big for me to handle alone.</b>

06:16.500 --> 06:21.540
<b>So, forget about apologizing.
I would rather have you all fight by my side instead.</b>

06:23.040 --> 06:26.630
<b>I've already caused my fair share
of problems for you guys, haven't I?</b>

06:27.630 --> 06:30.170
<b>Now we can just consider it even, okay?</b>

06:32.500 --> 06:33.830
<b>Please, everyone.</b>

06:34.250 --> 06:36.000
<b>I need you to help me out!</b>

06:39.250 --> 06:42.250
<b>Sure! I'll help you, Master Bell!</b>

06:42.500 --> 06:44.920
<b>Yeah. The Captain has spoken.</b>

06:45.210 --> 06:46.420
<b>Let's make sure we have his back!</b>

06:46.790 --> 06:47.460
<b>Right!</b>

06:47.710 --> 06:50.210
<b>Helping Master Bell is our duty!</b>

06:50.540 --> 06:52.580
<b>I will work hard to repay all of your kindness!</b>

06:52.790 --> 06:54.330
<b>No matter what it takes!</b>

06:54.540 --> 06:58.790
<b>Oh, Bell! I promise that I'll leak all of
the info that I get from the Guild to you!</b>

06:59.000 --> 07:00.960
<b>Wh-whoa, you don't have to go that far...</b>

07:02.000 --> 07:02.960
<b>Big news!</b>

07:03.170 --> 07:05.380
<b>The details of the War Game have been decided, guys!</b>

07:06.380 --> 07:09.460
<b>We're going to duke it out by playing Hide-and-Seek.</b>

07:09.750 --> 07:10.880
<b>Just like the kid's game.</b>

07:10.880 --> 07:12.080
<b>Hide-and-Seek?</b>

07:12.080 --> 07:12.710
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:13.670 --> 07:16.290
<b>The Gods will hide while the children seek them out.</b>

07:16.580 --> 07:18.580
<b>Whichever side finds the other first wins.</b>

07:19.080 --> 07:21.170
<b>We settled on this to compensate
for the difference in strength.</b>

07:21.580 --> 07:23.670
<b>I'll explain in more detail later, but to sum it up:</b>

07:24.040 --> 07:26.130
<b>Bringing any harm to the Gods is banned.</b>

07:26.880 --> 07:29.290
<b>But children fighting and obstructing each other...</b>

07:29.960 --> 07:30.670
<b>is allowed.</b>

07:33.960 --> 07:37.750
<b>I'll get to work forging Crozzo magic swords.
As many as time allows.</b>

07:38.960 --> 07:39.920
<b>Are you sure?</b>

07:40.250 --> 07:42.710
<b>We can't beat them without
pulling out all the stops, right?</b>

07:43.670 --> 07:45.080
<b>Let's formulate a strategy.</b>

07:45.460 --> 07:47.250
<b>We'll use every means at our disposal.</b>

07:48.630 --> 07:50.170
<b>I said that so confidently...</b>

07:50.460 --> 07:54.040
<b>But it's impossible! There is no good strategy!</b>

07:55.080 --> 07:56.670
<b>Little Miss Supporter!</b>

07:56.920 --> 07:58.250
<b>You've got a guest!</b>

07:59.580 --> 08:01.630
<b>Hey. Sorry to barge in on you.</b>

08:01.630 --> 08:03.540
<b>Huh?! Master Finn?</b>

08:03.880 --> 08:06.250
<b>What reason could a hero like you have to see me?</b>

08:06.670 --> 08:09.500
<b>Working all day and night to gather
intelligence on the enemy, eh?</b>

08:09.960 --> 08:13.880
<b>That's certainly what any strategist worth
their salt should be doing.</b>

08:14.080 --> 08:15.920
<b>But... you don't have to bother.</b>

08:16.170 --> 08:18.830
<b>Huh? Erm, well...</b>

08:18.830 --> 08:21.920
<b>Because I'm going to provide you
with all the information I have.</b>

08:22.750 --> 08:25.710
<b>And I've fought against the Freya Familia plenty of times.</b>

08:26.580 --> 08:28.500
<b>Why would you do that?</b>

08:29.290 --> 08:30.500
<b>Liliruca Arde.</b>

08:31.130 --> 08:35.040
<b>Figuring out my motives shouldn't
be your concern right now.</b>

08:35.500 --> 08:37.750
<b>You face a nearly hopeless battle.</b>

08:38.040 --> 08:40.210
<b>So you need to make use of whatever
advantage you can, right?</b>

08:42.880 --> 08:45.630
<b>I will train you on how to be a strategist.</b>

08:47.170 --> 08:48.920
<b>That would be amazing, Master Finn!</b>

08:49.500 --> 08:51.670
<b>Please share your expertise with me!</b>

08:52.580 --> 08:55.710
<b>I'm sure I'm not the only one
who wants to lend you guys a hand.</b>

08:56.710 --> 08:59.040
<b>Everyone in the city is ready to do their part.</b>

09:01.580 --> 09:03.630
<b>So what if we can't fight in the War Game?</b>

09:03.960 --> 09:05.920
<b>I'll still help you out, Argonaut boy!</b>

09:06.130 --> 09:09.790
<b>We'll be your sparring partners right up until the big day.</b>

09:11.380 --> 09:12.540
<b>Thank you!</b>

09:16.250 --> 09:18.670
<b>We're throwing our full support behind them.</b>

09:19.960 --> 09:24.330
<b>I can't deny that I'm interested to see just
how much my weapons can stand up...</b>

09:25.540 --> 09:27.460
<b>to the likes of the Freya Familia.</b>

09:29.000 --> 09:31.460
<b>We're gonna side with the Hestia Familia!</b>

09:31.710 --> 09:36.750
<b>The whole world has its eyes on this battle.
This is our big chance to make a name for ourselves!</b>

09:37.000 --> 09:40.750
<b>Yeah, right. You just want to help
Bell Cranel out of a tight spot.</b>

09:40.750 --> 09:42.630
<b>N-no way, man!</b>

09:43.880 --> 09:47.750
<b>Our Ganesha Familia will not
participate in the War Game!</b>

09:47.920 --> 09:49.080
<b>We will be overseers.</b>

09:49.460 --> 09:52.500
<b>Our job is to keep watch over the battlefield
and make sure the rules are followed!</b>

09:53.500 --> 09:55.380
<b>What are you two going to do?</b>

09:56.290 --> 09:57.420
<b>Stay out of it.</b>

09:57.830 --> 09:59.250
<b>Or at least that's what I wanted!</b>

09:59.500 --> 10:04.460
<b>But my damn kids won't listen to me!
They're going to join the allied army!</b>

10:04.630 --> 10:06.330
<b>All cuz of that bonehead, Dormul!</b>

10:06.960 --> 10:10.290
<b>I have the same problem with Luvis;
he keeps saying he "owes them"!</b>

10:10.670 --> 10:14.130
<b>This is the end! Our Familias are doomed!</b>

10:14.420 --> 10:17.830
<b>Now is the time for us to serve
that bitch Freya her just desserts!</b>

10:17.830 --> 10:20.710
<b>Our Goddess Alliance will go all in on the War Game!</b>

10:22.380 --> 10:25.420
<b>Seems like a lot of people are rooting for them.</b>

10:30.630 --> 10:31.920
<b>I know they'll pull off a win.</b>

10:33.830 --> 10:35.500
<b>No way. They're screwed.</b>

10:36.630 --> 10:40.790
<b>It doesn't matter how much they bolster their forces,
it's pointless without the Loki Familia on their side.</b>

10:41.830 --> 10:44.000
<b>So, we're not going to participate, then?</b>

10:44.540 --> 10:45.580
<b>Does that upset you?</b>

10:46.000 --> 10:49.710
<b>I think your decision is the right one given
the circumstances, Master Hermes.</b>

10:50.130 --> 10:50.750
<b>However,</b>

10:51.040 --> 10:52.580
<b>you won't be able to stop Aisha.</b>

10:53.380 --> 10:57.920
<b>Her Guild registration lists her as belonging to
a fake party anyways, so it shouldn't be a problem.</b>

10:58.460 --> 11:02.750
<b>I'm going to offer Liliruca Arde every item in
our arsenal, except for those that are banned.</b>

11:03.500 --> 11:04.460
<b>That's fine with me.</b>

11:04.920 --> 11:07.330
<b>It won't be enough to tip the scales in their favor.</b>

11:08.710 --> 11:10.960
<b>If there's any hope of them winning, it's...</b>

11:12.830 --> 11:15.420
<b>Congratulations, Bell. You're level 5 now.</b>

11:15.830 --> 11:18.790
<b>And you've obtained a new skill called "Vanadis Tevere".</b>

11:19.250 --> 11:20.920
<b>It makes you stronger against charm.</b>

11:21.290 --> 11:24.960
<b>Also, your "Escape" ability has
gone up from I rank to G rank.</b>

11:24.960 --> 11:25.580
<b>Huh?</b>

11:25.580 --> 11:29.540
<b>Oh, it boosts your speed whenever you're being chased.</b>

11:32.500 --> 11:38.460
<b>Goddess... do you think I stand any chance
in battle against the Freya Familia's top brass?</b>

11:40.330 --> 11:45.250
<b>I'm not a Goddess of war,
so I can't really say anything specific.</b>

11:45.710 --> 11:47.000
<b>But regardless...</b>

11:49.080 --> 11:53.750
<b>I don't think you'll actually be able
to compete against Freya's children.</b>

11:56.830 --> 11:58.380
<b>I still have to try.</b>

12:02.420 --> 12:05.670
<b>The details of the War Game
have been finalized, Lady Freya.</b>

12:06.170 --> 12:09.790
<b>It will begin 6 days from now.
The battlefield will be the Olza City ruins.</b>

12:10.580 --> 12:11.330
<b>I see.</b>

12:12.540 --> 12:14.420
<b>May I ask you a question?</b>

12:16.130 --> 12:19.630
<b>What made you keep the Sword Princess
away from the rabbit boy?</b>

12:20.540 --> 12:26.130
<b>Because training with the Sword Princess could
potentially make him far stronger than he is now.</b>

12:26.630 --> 12:31.420
<b>Do you honestly believe we would have
trouble dealing with him, even if that happened?</b>

12:31.880 --> 12:34.500
<b>I'm just doing whatever it takes to make sure he's mine.</b>

12:36.790 --> 12:38.040
<b>My apologies for speaking out of line.</b>

12:38.670 --> 12:39.630
<b>Excuse me.</b>

12:46.330 --> 12:47.540
<b>I'm such a joke.</b>

12:48.330 --> 12:50.290
<b>It was nothing but jealousy.</b>

12:53.540 --> 12:56.580
<b>Man, this sucks. I wanted to help Bell grow a bit more.</b>

12:56.580 --> 12:58.710
<b>Why are you whining like a little girl?</b>

13:00.830 --> 13:04.500
<b>I can't stop you from feeling an affinity for him,
but remember that when push comes to shove...</b>

13:04.960 --> 13:06.130
<b>It's not a problem!</b>

13:06.750 --> 13:08.830
<b>When we face each other in battle,</b>

13:08.830 --> 13:12.170
<b>I shall not hesitate to brandish my blade
and cut him limb from limb.</b>

13:13.670 --> 13:15.130
<b>Nothing is working.</b>

13:15.670 --> 13:19.880
<b>I obeyed Lady Freya's wishes and
kept Horn alive by healing all her wounds.</b>

13:20.790 --> 13:22.330
<b>But she still won't wake up.</b>

13:22.790 --> 13:24.540
<b>So, she's just in a deathlike state?</b>

13:24.960 --> 13:28.250
<b>As a Healer, I find it very hard to accept that description,</b>

13:28.750 --> 13:30.330
<b>but it's not wrong.</b>

13:31.460 --> 13:35.670
<b>I must say, you really are a problematic woman, Horn.</b>

13:36.880 --> 13:40.210
<b>What were you hoping to achieve
by going as far as to betray Lady Freya?</b>

13:42.750 --> 13:44.880
<b>I can't make any sense of it.</b>

13:45.580 --> 13:47.500
<b>Do you know what's preventing her from waking up?</b>

13:48.290 --> 13:51.330
<b>Well, I'm only human, so the best I can do is guess.</b>

13:51.790 --> 13:52.670
<b>That's fine.</b>

13:53.580 --> 13:58.830
<b>Lady Freya tried to kill off her "Syr" persona,
but now Horn is keeping it alive.</b>

13:59.710 --> 14:02.580
<b>The reason Vana Seith hasn't completely worn off</b>

14:02.920 --> 14:08.040
<b>is possibly because Horn is using her magic to maintain
the spell and prevent something from being lost...</b>

14:10.750 --> 14:12.380
<b>It's utter nonsense.</b>

14:13.290 --> 14:14.040
<b>Right.</b>

14:16.750 --> 14:19.830
<b>What sort of dream are you having right now?</b>

14:22.420 --> 14:23.540
<b>Anya...</b>

14:23.920 --> 14:25.460
<b>How long are you gonna mope around for?</b>

14:27.710 --> 14:29.460
<b>Lady Freya is Syr, right?</b>

14:29.750 --> 14:32.880
<b>Then we gotta go talk things out with her,
even if that means doing it the hard way!</b>

14:36.290 --> 14:37.880
<b>Say something, you dumb cat!</b>

14:37.880 --> 14:38.830
<b>Enough, Lunor.</b>

14:39.460 --> 14:41.960
<b>Then lay there like a sad sack and die for all I care!</b>

14:47.460 --> 14:50.420
<b>Don't you want the tavern to go back
to how it used to be, Anya?</b>

14:52.540 --> 14:54.170
<b>That's what I want.</b>

14:54.960 --> 14:57.420
<b>The rest of us are going to fight in the War Game.</b>

15:00.250 --> 15:01.460
<b>We'll be waiting for you.</b>

15:08.830 --> 15:11.170
<b>It's impawssible for me to fight anymore...</b>

15:11.710 --> 15:12.830
<b>I'm too scared.</b>

15:23.170 --> 15:24.380
<b>Big Brother?</b>

15:34.630 --> 15:35.630
<b>All right.</b>

15:35.630 --> 15:39.000
<b>Seems like you've adjusted to your new level,
and just in the nick of time.</b>

15:39.500 --> 15:41.460
<b>I seriously can't thank you two enough.</b>

15:42.210 --> 15:44.580
<b>If only Ais had been able to help out, too...</b>

15:45.130 --> 15:46.170
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

15:46.540 --> 15:49.170
<b>I know circumstances were beyond her control.
And besides...</b>

15:49.960 --> 15:53.040
<b>I've already taken everything that
Ms. Ais taught me to heart.</b>

15:55.380 --> 15:56.460
<b>Knock 'em dead, kid!</b>

15:56.460 --> 15:57.330
<b>Thanks!</b>

16:00.000 --> 16:06.790
<b>Good morning, folks! The day of
the big War Game is finally upon us!</b>

16:08.080 --> 16:11.250
<b>I'm your play-by-play announcer, Ibly Archer.</b>

16:11.540 --> 16:13.710
<b>And here to provide commentary is...</b>

16:13.710 --> 16:16.420
<b>none other than our head honcho himself!</b>

16:16.920 --> 16:19.670
<b>I AM GANESHA!</b>

16:19.670 --> 16:21.130
<b>YEAH!</b>

16:21.130 --> 16:23.750
<b>This will be an unprecedented battle between factions!</b>

16:23.750 --> 16:27.330
<b>The Freya Familia, lauded as the strongest in the city,</b>

16:27.330 --> 16:31.040
<b>will be clashing against an allied army
led by the Hestia Familia!</b>

16:31.250 --> 16:33.750
<b>The name of the game is: Hide-and-Seek!</b>

16:34.130 --> 16:36.830
<b>The allied army will have territory
on the east side of the island,</b>

16:36.830 --> 16:39.580
<b>while the west side will belong to the Freya Familia.</b>

16:39.580 --> 16:43.960
<b>Each God will hide somewhere in their respective
territory while the children seek them out!</b>

16:44.290 --> 16:45.960
<b>Just like the name implies!</b>

16:46.380 --> 16:49.250
<b>Except this is no regular game of Hide-and-Seek.</b>

16:49.630 --> 16:52.960
<b>Members from opposing Familia will be
allowed to fight and obstruct each other,</b>

16:52.960 --> 16:55.080
<b>which basically makes this a battle royale!</b>

16:55.500 --> 16:57.130
<b>Either fight to protect your patron God,</b>

16:57.130 --> 16:59.380
<b>or hunt down the opposing one!</b>

16:59.500 --> 17:05.000
<b>Who knows how gruesome and bloody this battle
will turn out when the dust finally settles!</b>

17:05.330 --> 17:06.960
<b>But there's a catch!</b>

17:06.960 --> 17:14.250
<b>While the Freya Familia must find all of the Gods
who are allied with Hestia in order to win,</b>

17:14.460 --> 17:16.750
<b>the allied army can claim victory
by only finding Lady Freya!</b>

17:16.750 --> 17:19.960
<b>That seems to tip the advantage in their favor!</b>

17:19.960 --> 17:22.330
<b>What's your take on it, Master Ganesha?</b>

17:22.540 --> 17:26.000
<b>To be honest, I still don't think
that's enough of a handicap.</b>

17:26.380 --> 17:29.130
<b>Master Ganesha dropping truth bombs!</b>

17:32.830 --> 17:35.420
<b>Listen up, everybody. This will be our last briefing.</b>

17:36.880 --> 17:40.790
<b>All Gods must openly wear the flowers
they were given. Don't try to hide them.</b>

17:41.250 --> 17:45.330
<b>If your flower goes missing or gets stolen by the
other side, then you're out.</b>

17:45.670 --> 17:47.580
<b>And all members of your Familia have to leave.</b>

17:48.040 --> 17:52.170
<b>That's why I want all the Gods to focus on
staying in as long as possible by running or hiding.</b>

17:53.290 --> 17:54.290
<b>You're up, Miss Supporter.</b>

17:57.630 --> 17:59.880
<b>I would like the Gods to decide their own positions.</b>

18:00.500 --> 18:05.500
<b>Letting me dictate everything is a bad idea. That will just
make it easier for the enemy to find patterns and flaws.</b>

18:06.210 --> 18:11.250
<b>So it's better for the Gods to choose their own hiding
places independently from my strategy.</b>

18:14.290 --> 18:16.920
<b>Let me be perfectly blunt.</b>

18:17.500 --> 18:19.040
<b>We're going up against a brilliant strategist.</b>

18:19.540 --> 18:21.250
<b>Someone far smarter than I am.</b>

18:21.710 --> 18:26.460
<b>Despite our superior numbers, I know for a fact
that we'll lose if we just try to attack them head-on.</b>

18:26.880 --> 18:30.040
<b>That's how powerful the Freya Familia is.</b>

18:31.460 --> 18:32.290
<b>But...</b>

18:35.920 --> 18:38.250
<b>But... even so!</b>

18:47.250 --> 18:49.330
<b>I want to win this!</b>

18:50.420 --> 18:53.920
<b>Lady Freya crossed a line and needs to learn a lesson!</b>

18:54.250 --> 18:56.380
<b>I don't want to be separated from Master Bell!</b>

18:56.790 --> 19:00.170
<b>I refuse to let her take away someone so important to us!</b>

19:00.710 --> 19:02.830
<b>So pull your weight, adventurers!</b>

19:03.250 --> 19:05.790
<b>Because I'm gonna lead your sorry asses to victory!</b>

19:12.040 --> 19:14.670
<b>All right!</b>

19:14.670 --> 19:16.880
<b>Hell yeah! Let's do this!</b>

19:16.880 --> 19:19.080
<b>That kid sure knows how to egg us on!</b>

19:19.080 --> 19:22.290
<b>Ah! Lili is just phenomenal!</b>

19:27.210 --> 19:30.290
<b>That was amazing! I felt like I was watching Mr. Finn!</b>

19:30.710 --> 19:33.380
<b>Well, it was actually Master Finn
who came up with the whole idea for me.</b>

19:33.920 --> 19:37.920
<b>"You have the advantage of a cute face,
so start off by being charming and sweet,</b>

19:38.170 --> 19:41.080
<b>"then follow it up with some tough words
to galvanize them into action."</b>

19:43.960 --> 19:45.130
<b>What's the matter?</b>

19:45.670 --> 19:50.080
<b>Can I talk to you? I have a hunch about something
that might happen during the war.</b>

19:52.210 --> 19:54.500
<b>After all the allied forces reach the island,</b>

19:54.710 --> 19:57.380
<b>they must move to their assigned
territory on the east side!</b>

19:58.460 --> 20:01.500
<b>I didn't think you were the type
to get in on the action, Bors.</b>

20:01.830 --> 20:06.880
<b>Aw, shaddap! This is the last thing I wanted to do,
but I owe one to Rabbit's Foot!</b>

20:07.500 --> 20:08.790
<b>Open the gate!</b>

20:17.040 --> 20:19.790
<b>Honestly, I find that idea pretty hard to swallow...</b>

20:20.040 --> 20:21.710
<b>Yeah, I figured.</b>

20:22.170 --> 20:25.330
<b>But keep it somewhere in the back
of your mind for me, okay?</b>

20:25.790 --> 20:26.670
<b>All right.</b>

20:27.330 --> 20:28.630
<b>U-um...</b>

20:29.080 --> 20:32.250
<b>Can I speak with you for a little bit, too?</b>

20:33.170 --> 20:37.290
<b>Ms. Cassandra? Let me guess,
did you have another dream?</b>

20:37.290 --> 20:38.460
<b>Y-yes!</b>

20:39.250 --> 20:42.710
<b>I saw a bunch of different things happening
across a twilight-colored plain...</b>

20:43.130 --> 20:44.670
<b>There was an Elf and a Prum!</b>

20:44.960 --> 20:46.630
<b>Then a boar and a chariot!</b>

20:48.880 --> 20:50.380
<b>But the wind will blow in our favor!</b>

20:54.170 --> 20:56.040
<b>The "wind", huh...?</b>

21:00.330 --> 21:03.000
<b>Lady Freya. Your flower has arrived.</b>

21:03.630 --> 21:05.170
<b>Please wear it on your chest.</b>

21:05.830 --> 21:07.500
<b>Talk about ironic.</b>

21:09.210 --> 21:10.040
<b>What is?</b>

21:18.880 --> 21:20.500
<b>You must win, Ottarl.</b>

21:20.710 --> 21:21.290
<b>Yes ma'am.</b>

21:21.710 --> 21:23.790
<b>Bell is going to be mine.</b>

21:24.420 --> 21:26.750
<b>This is the only way left to claim him.</b>

21:27.880 --> 21:30.290
<b>I am wholly devoted to Her Ladyship.</b>

21:31.580 --> 21:34.080
<b>So you better heed my every beck and call!</b>

21:34.630 --> 21:36.000
<b>To war, comrades!</b>

21:49.290 --> 21:51.880
<b>Come. Show me why you're her favorite.</b>

21:53.460 --> 21:54.960
<b>Without further ado...</b>

21:55.170 --> 21:59.290
<b>let the War Game begin!</b>

22:19.040 --> 22:21.670
<b>Kono himitsu shizume</b>

22:21.670 --> 22:24.130
<b>Yuredasu suimen ni</b>

22:24.540 --> 22:28.710
<b>Kizuku yochi ga atta mitai</b>

22:29.500 --> 22:36.210
<b>Umaku arawasenai sore de ite masshiro na omoi</b>

22:36.210 --> 22:39.380
<b>Yobeba mata hoshiku naru</b>

22:39.380 --> 22:44.380
<b>Hayaru kanjou sore wa uneru nami no you</b>

22:44.750 --> 22:49.960
<b>Chikutto sotto shirazu ni hareteku</b>

22:51.040 --> 22:57.580
<b>Soshite hedateta kabe kuzurete rikai shita kotoba wa</b>

22:57.710 --> 23:02.040
<b>Tada yuratto sora ni ukanderu</b>

23:02.540 --> 23:08.080
<b>Tatoe kara demo koeteku ai hoshii</b>

23:08.330 --> 23:13.670
<b>Douse yume nara uso mo tsuredashite</b>

23:13.670 --> 23:17.330
<b>Tatoe ubaenai sei demo</b>

23:17.460 --> 23:22.920
<b>Kokoro o sukoshi mitashite kawaru</b>

23:23.210 --> 23:28.880
<b>Memai no you na muku na kasumi</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.000
<b>Next time</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.000
<b>Fólkvangr</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:41.000
<b>Hell</b>

23:36.880 --> 23:39.170
<b>Next time: "Fólkvangr".</b>
